From: Bernhard Wiedemann <bwiedemann@suse.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Main: CompositionTechnique - include OgreTexture.h for TextureType
Date: 2026-11-18

TextureDefinition uses TextureType and TEX_TYPE_2D, but the header
only got them transitively. Since 14, OgreCompositorManager.h alone
no longer compiles.

--- a/OgreMain/include/OgreCompositionTechnique.h
+++ b/OgreMain/include/OgreCompositionTechnique.h
@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@
 
 #include "OgrePrerequisites.h"
 #include "OgrePixelFormat.h"
+#include "OgreTexture.h"
 #include "OgreHeaderPrefix.h"
 
 namespace Ogre {
